00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:12.870
<v Narrator>Nweta na OpenIE Research Radio Planetary Digest, na-akọwapụta 29 nnyocha mepere emepe na-emepe emepe na-ekwenyere, ike-ekwere computing.

2
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:33.248
<v Narrator>N'ime anyị 4-stage lookup-first cascade, ngwa ngwa oge hash table, trigram search indices, na nke ziri ezi integer solvers na-elekọta ajụjụ rutine na mpaghara, na-enwe nnukwu neural models naanị dị ka ihe mgbaru ọsọ.

3
00:00:33.328 --> 00:01:00.135
<v Narrator>N'ime 5-volt board shunts na 0.09 ruo 0.11 pasent nke idle drift, unpacking 0.1517 bits-per-weight matrices azụ ka 32-bit floats wasted 81.86 ugboro karịa board ike karịa 8-bit integers, ebe packed integer logic gbadara na 187.49 microjoules gross na cut full cascade energy 26.58 oge.

4
00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:20.890
<v Narrator>Akwụkwọ ọ bụla na-eburu ụgbọ mmiri na cryptographic hashes, determinism nke 6-fabric cross-architecture, 24-kilobit Opus low-bandwidth feeds, audio description extended, na Creative Commons Zero plain-language summaries.
